---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const subject = encodeURIComponent('Axolotl Odyssey — problem report');
---

<Page title={`Support — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Get help with a Bioluma Labs game, or report a problem.">
	<h1>Support</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		Something not working, or stuck somewhere? Email us and a real person will reply.
	</p>

	<div class="card">
		<p class="big">
			<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${subject}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
		</p>
		<p class="muted small">We usually reply within a few working days, from the same address.</p>
	</div>

	<h2>What to include in a report</h2>
	<p>The more of these you can include, the faster we can fix it:</p>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>The game</strong>, for example Axolotl Odyssey.</li>
		<li><strong>Your device and system</strong>, for example "iPad Air, iPadOS 18" or "Windows 11 laptop".</li>
		<li><strong>Your browser</strong>, for example Safari, Chrome or Edge.</li>
		<li><strong>Where you were</strong> in the game: the level or place name at the top of the screen.</li>
		<li><strong>What you did</strong>, step by step, just before it happened.</li>
		<li><strong>What happened</strong>, and what you expected to happen instead.</li>
		<li><strong>A screenshot or short video</strong>, if you can.</li>
		<li><strong>Whether it happens again</strong> if you reload the page and try the same thing.</li>
	</ol>

	<h2>Before you write</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>No sound?</strong> Check Sound and Music under Settings on the title screen and your device's silent switch, then tap the screen once.</li>
		<li><strong>Something looks stuck?</strong> Reloading the page is safe. The game saves at checkpoint pools, and <em>Continue</em> picks up from there.</li>
	</ul>

	<p class="muted small">
		Please don't include personal information about a child in your message. If you're under 13,
		ask a parent or carer to email us for you. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a>.
	</p>
</Page>

<style>
	.card {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.big {
		font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1rem + 1.2vw, 1.5rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}
	.small {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		margin: 0;
	}
	ol li::marker {
		color: var(--glow);
	}
</style>
